<title>POLAND: Poland offers PLN 700 mln 10-yr bonds on April 8.</title>
<headline>Poland offers PLN 700 mln 10-yr bonds on April 8.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland offered 400 million zlotys of 10-year bonds maturing on April 18, 2007 and 300 million of 10-year bonds due on April 18, 2006 at a primary tender on April 8, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The value date for the auction is April 17, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
